html.append('<h1>MSI2 324 versus 328<br>Analysis comparison registry</h1><p>A synthesis of existing calculations, their lineage, and their limits. No normalization, model fitting, peak calling, or new biological test was run to build this report.</p><p class="source">Saved p-values displayed as 0 reflect numerical underflow, not a probability proven to be exactly zero. Wilson intervals treat sites as sampling units and do not account for within-gene dependence.</p>')
